<title>UK: BOE forecasts 800 mln stg shortage, offers help.</title>
<headline>BOE forecasts 800 mln stg shortage, offers help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England invited an early round of fixed rate operations after forecasting a liquidity shortage of 800 million stg.</p>
<p>The operations will comprise 6.0 percent repos to April 23 and 25 and outright offers of bills maturing on or before April 25.</p>
</text>
